nsas/jewell-county"],["ARC or PLC in Jewell County","/arc-plc/kansas/jewell-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 40 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025, February to March on the middle ran 33% of normal, and June to July ran 141%. So far in 2026, February to March on the middle came in at 27% and April to May at 72%. Grid 23527 had its driest year in 1956 at 51%.</p>"}
